{"segs": ["PA_thig_1.18:0.1", "PA_thig_1.18:0.2"], "en": "Therīgāthā 1.18 Ekakanipāta Saṅghātherīgāthā The Verses of the Elder Nun Saṅghā,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thig_1.18:0.3"], "en": "from the First Book of Single Verses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thig_1.18:1.1"], "en": "“Having left the home life and gone forth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thig_1.18:1.2"], "en": "having abandoned son, cattle, and what is dear,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thig_1.18:1.3"], "en": "and having abandoned both lust and hatred— ”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thig_1.18:1.4", "PA_thig_1.18:1.5"], "en": "Having dispelled ignorance and having uprooted craving,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thig_1.18:1.6"], "en": "I am stilled and extinguished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thig_1.18:2.1", "PA_thig_1.18:3.1"], "en": "… Saṅghā, the Elder Nun … The First Book of Single Verses is finished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"}
